# Nexus environment variables (all OPTIONAL).
#
# In normal use you don't need a .env file: the launcher injects these
# when it spawns the server, and the satellite reads its own settings
# file. They're documented here for headless / kiosk / dev setups.
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and uncomment what you need.

# --- Web app / launcher-spawned server ---
# Where the server reads/writes its JSON data (preferences, layouts,
# overlays). Defaults to the OS app-data dir. Set to pin a custom path.
# NEXUS_DATA_DIR=./.nexus-data

# --- Nexus Cross (Stream Deck satellite) ---
# Seed the satellite's defaults so a fresh install connects without UI.
# NEXUS_SERVER=http://192.168.1.10:9088
# NEXUS_ID=studio-deck-1
# NEXUS_LABEL=Studio Deck 1
